  <lyrics>
    <verse name="v1">
      <lines>
      <chord name="F"/>Safely through another <chord name="C"/>week God has <chord name="C7"/>brought us on our <chord name="F"/>way;<br/>
      <chord name="F"/>Let us now a blessing <chord name="C"/>seek, Waiting <chord name="F"/>in His <chord name="C"/>courts <chord name="G7"/>to<chord name="C"/>day;<br/>
      <chord name="C7"/>Day of <chord name="F"/>all the week the <chord name="C"/>best, Emblem <chord name="F"/>of eternal <chord name="C"/>rest:<br/>
      <chord name="C7"/>Day of <chord name="F"/>all the week the <chord name="C"/>best, <chord name="F"/>Emblem of eter<chord name="C7"/>nal <chord name="F"/>rest.
      </lines>
    </verse>
    <verse name="v2">
      <lines>
      <chord name="F"/>While <chord name="C"/>we seek <chord name="C7"/>supplies <chord name="F"/>of grace,<br/>
      <chord name="F"/><chord name="C"/>Thro&#x27; <chord name="F"/>the <chord name="C"/>dear <chord name="G7"/>Redeemer&#x27;s <chord name="C"/>name,<br/>
      <chord name="C7"/><chord name="F"/>Show <chord name="C"/>Thy <chord name="F"/>reconciling <chord name="C"/>face;<br/>
      <chord name="C7"/>Take <chord name="F"/>away <chord name="C"/>the <chord name="F"/>sin <chord name="C7"/>and <chord name="F"/>shame:<br/>
      <chord name="F"/>From <chord name="C"/>our worldly <chord name="C7"/>cares <chord name="F"/>set free,<br/>
      <chord name="F"/>May <chord name="C"/>we <chord name="F"/>rest <chord name="C"/>this <chord name="G7"/>day <chord name="C"/>in Thee:<br/>
      <chord name="C7"/>From <chord name="F"/>our <chord name="C"/>worldly <chord name="F"/>cares <chord name="C"/>set free,<br/>
      <chord name="C7"/>May <chord name="F"/>we <chord name="C"/>rest <chord name="F"/>this <chord name="C7"/>day <chord name="F"/>in Thee.
      </lines>
    </verse>
    <verse name="v3">
      <lines>
      <chord name="F"/>When <chord name="C"/>the more <chord name="C7"/>shall bid <chord name="F"/>us rise,<br/>
      <chord name="F"/>May <chord name="C"/>we <chord name="F"/>feel <chord name="C"/>Thy <chord name="G7"/>presence <chord name="C"/>near;<br/>
      <chord name="C7"/>May <chord name="F"/>Thy <chord name="C"/>glory <chord name="F"/>meet <chord name="C"/>our eyes,<br/>
      <chord name="C7"/>While <chord name="F"/>we <chord name="C"/>in <chord name="F"/>Thy <chord name="C7"/>house <chord name="F"/>appear:<br/>
      <chord name="F"/>Here <chord name="C"/>afford us, <chord name="C7"/>Lord, <chord name="F"/>a taste<br/>
      <chord name="F"/><chord name="C"/>Of <chord name="F"/>our <chord name="C"/><chord name="G7"/>everlasting <chord name="C"/>feast:<br/>
      <chord name="C7"/>Here <chord name="F"/>afford <chord name="C"/>us, <chord name="F"/>Lord, <chord name="C"/>a taste<br/>
      <chord name="C7"/><chord name="F"/>Of <chord name="C"/>our <chord name="F"/><chord name="C7"/>everlasting <chord name="F"/>feast.
      </lines>
    </verse>
    <verse name="v4">
      <lines>
      <chord name="F"/>May <chord name="C"/>the <chord name="C7"/>gospel&#x27;s <chord name="F"/>joyful sound<br/>
      <chord name="F"/><chord name="C"/>Conquer <chord name="F"/>sinners, <chord name="C"/><chord name="G7"/>comfort <chord name="C"/>saints;<br/>
      <chord name="C7"/>Make <chord name="F"/>the <chord name="C"/>fruits <chord name="F"/>of <chord name="C"/>grace abound,<br/>
      <chord name="C7"/><chord name="F"/>Bring <chord name="C"/>relief <chord name="F"/>to <chord name="C7"/>all <chord name="F"/>complaints:<br/>
      <chord name="F"/>Thus <chord name="C"/>may all <chord name="C7"/>our <chord name="F"/>Sabbaths be,<br/>
      <chord name="F"/>Till <chord name="C"/>we <chord name="F"/>we rise <chord name="C"/>to <chord name="G7"/>reign <chord name="C"/>with Thee.<br/>
      <chord name="C7"/>Thus <chord name="F"/>may <chord name="C"/>all <chord name="F"/>our <chord name="C"/>Sabbaths be,<br/>
      <chord name="C7"/>Till <chord name="F"/>we <chord name="C"/>we rise <chord name="F"/>to <chord name="C7"/>reign <chord name="F"/>with Thee.
      </lines>
    </verse>
